{"root":{"data":{"id":"2907905b7cb5","created":1576424156,"text":"测试驱动开发(施工中)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bz63sfducoow","created":1576424338422,"text":"资金实例","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bz6h9jjp1q00","created":1576462354102,"text":"开发一个典型的完全由测试驱动的代码模型，迅速了解测试驱动开发(Test-Driven Development，TDD)的过程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bz6ha6lsvbc0","created":1576462404296,"text":"TDD过程步骤：\n1 快速新增一个测试\n2 运行所有的测试，发现最新的测试不能通过\n3 做一些小小的改动\n4 运行所有的测试，并且全部通过\n5 重构（refractor）代码，消除重复设计（duplication），优化设计结构"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bz93vuzvzmo0","created":1576729287369,"text":"依赖关系(dependency)与重复设计(duplication)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bz93weh3ojk0","created":1576729329769,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bz63shdtiz9c","created":1576424342774,"text":"xUnit实例"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bz63sqcbbqbk","created":1576424362274,"text":"测试驱动开发的模式"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}